        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Games. One Goal: Don’t Explode.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a chaotic, turn-based party game where every decision inches you closer to disaster. Choose between <strong>Hot Potato</strong>, a tense bomb-passing showdown, or <strong>Draw 31</strong>, a strategic card game where going over means going boom. Easy to learn, hard to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hot Potato:</i></strong> <br>A live C4 is in play. Each turn, the bomb ticks closer to detonation. You can <strong>pass it</strong>, <strong>try to disarm it</strong>, or <strong>hold on</strong> and bluff your way through. Fail too many times and you earn <strong>strikes</strong>—three strikes and you're toast.<br>Successfully defuse the bomb? You’ll earn <strong>abilities</strong> to use in future rounds, giving you an edge when the heat is on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854840/extras/4fd7e36a6dbe1def23271946e0cfd0e8.avif?t=1758904624\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Draw 31:</i></strong> <br>Play cards in a tense race to hit exactly <strong>31</strong>. Go over and take a <strong>strike</strong>. Hit 31 perfectly? Everyone else gets one. With <strong>three strikes</strong>, you're out. A clever mix of luck, math, and sabotage makes every hand count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854840/extras/fdcadf341a16bef39fb4dbe74e022da6.avif?t=1758904624\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Games. One Goal: Don’t Explode.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a chaotic, turn-based party game where every decision inches you closer to disaster. Choose between <strong>Hot Potato</strong>, a tense bomb-passing showdown, or <strong>Draw 31</strong>, a strategic card game where going over means going boom. Easy to learn, hard to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hot Potato:</i></strong> <br>A live C4 is in play. Each turn, the bomb ticks closer to detonation. You can <strong>pass it</strong>, <strong>try to disarm it</strong>, or <strong>hold on</strong> and bluff your way through. Fail too many times and you earn <strong>strikes</strong>—three strikes and you're toast.<br>Successfully defuse the bomb? You’ll earn <strong>abilities</strong> to use in future rounds, giving you an edge when the heat is on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854840/extras/4fd7e36a6dbe1def23271946e0cfd0e8.avif?t=1758904624\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Draw 31:</i></strong> <br>Play cards in a tense race to hit exactly <strong>31</strong>. Go over and take a <strong>strike</strong>. Hit 31 perfectly? Everyone else gets one. With <strong>three strikes</strong>, you're out. A clever mix of luck, math, and sabotage makes every hand count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854840/extras/fdcadf341a16bef39fb4dbe74e022da6.avif?t=1758904624\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
